  m_Name: Clockmaker Cornelius
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Clockmaker Cornelius
  offerText: I offer you a grand, grandfather clock at a steep discount. It demands
    a vast amount of floor space, but its rhythmic ticking screams sophistication.
  acceptResultText: The massive clock is installed. It looks incredibly elegant,
    though you can barely walk around it.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the bulky monstrosity. Feeling liberated by your minimalist
    choice, you finally throw away some old boxes, making the room feel incredibly
    spacious.
  acceptedDelayedText: The clock's ticking grows maddeningly loud, echoing in your
    skull and completely preventing you from resting.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
